OL,3,GNEWSAService to mark 11 years since
OL,4,AShoreham air crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA service to mark the 11th anniversary
OL,7,Fof the Shoreham air crash will be held
OL,8,Fin the town on Saturday afternoon.
OL,10,FEleven men were killed on 22 August
OL,11,F2015 when pilot Andrew Hill crashed a
OL,12,Fvintage Hawker Hunter jet on to the A27
OL,13,Fwhile attempting to perform a mid-air
OL,14,Fstunt.
OL,16,FRev Pat Alden, a retired priest working
OL,17,Fat St Nicholas Church in Old Shoreham,
OL,18,Fsais this service is not solely to
OL,19,Fhonour those who died.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
